Package: GROMICA
Title: GROMACS Molecular Dynamics Interactive Computational Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Hafeez", "Ur Rehman", email = "hafeez@nwafu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for analyzing and visualizing GROMACS molecular dynamics simulation results. Provides functions for RMSD, RMSF, radius of gyration, SASA, and hydrogen bond analysis with publication-quality output.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/hafeez-dawar/GROMICA
BugReports: https://github.com/hafeez-dawar/GROMICA/issues
